---

<section class="pcta" id="cta">
  <div class="wrap pcta-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>The next step</span>
    <h2>Give your team a <em>governed place</em> to build.</h2>
    <p>
      A short call with one of our platform engineers. We'll walk through your data, your governance posture, and what your team would ship first.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
        Talk to a platform engineer <span class="arr">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-secondary">
        See pricing
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="promise">
      <span>SSO, audit, hosting · day one</span>
      <span>Your team owns every app</span>
      <span>No lock-in · export any time</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pcta {
    padding: 140px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background:
      radial-gradient(800px 400px at 50% 0%, var(--color-lavender-50), transparent 70%),
      #fff;
  }
  .pcta-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .pcta .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .pcta h2 {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
  }
  .pcta h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--color-indigo-600); }
  .pcta p {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .row {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .promise {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .promise span::before {
    content: "›";
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
    margin-right: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
